  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder (config_005, 0.6501 accuracy) outperform PCA-based variants. However, the optimal aggregation method (avgpool vs transformer) remains uncertain. This experiment tests multiprofile with scvi_n200 and transformer aggregation, isolating the effect of aggregation strategy. It directly compares the performance of avgpool (config_005) vs transformer, helping determine if aggregation method matters when using the superior scvi_n200 encoder. This balances exploitation of the promising scvi_n200 encoder with exploration of aggregation choices."
}

